  "comment": "Racing with tilt steering. Design: touch-genre-profiles.md section 7, enlarged to >= 92 pt and moved inside the safe area. Gyro = touch-gyro.md lean-steer preset: mapGyroTo stick, rollToLeftStick, gyroSensitivityRoll 1.0, rollFactor 1.0, gyroToStickMinOffset 0 (MotionHandler.swift:528: full left stick at +-60 deg of lean). CONFLICT: the genre design wants full lock at +-30 deg, which needs gyroSensitivityRoll 2.0 (the same formula gives 50 % at 30 deg with 1.0); fix by setting 2.0 here. Left at the preset's 1.0. In game: steering linearity/deadzone 0; calibrate by holding the resting pose, then tap Steer.",
